  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUPPORTING ENERGY SECTOR REFORM IN UKRAINE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The planned effect of the project on the society is that effectice reforms in Ukraine&apos;s energy sector promote its efficiency for advancing  the sector&apos;s attractivness, competivitiness and development.Planned outcomes are reviewed architecture and governance of the energy sector, enhanced government capacity to carry out the SOE sector reform in line with international standards, improved competition practices in the energy sector and strengthened anti-corruption measures.</narrative>
  </description>
